WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:03.509
Hi, I'm Tilly! Let's start the screen saver.

00:00:04.463 --> 00:00:06.463
Press shift S in window mode.

00:00:06.948 --> 00:00:10.468
It's made from your own screen, and there are 36 effects.

00:00:19.509 --> 00:00:21.145
Any key brings your screen back.

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:25.329
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
